### Fraud & Risk Service – API examples (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP client)
### Tokens: log in through the Auth Service. Organizer tokens need a tenantId claim.

@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@serviceToken = paste-SERVICE-token
@organizerToken = paste-ORGANIZER-token-with-tenantId-10
@studentToken = paste-student-token
@adminToken = paste-ADMIN-token

### Health (no token)
GET http://localhost:8090/actuator/health

### 1. First use of a UPI reference -> 201, CLEAR
POST {{gateway}}/api/fraud/checks
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"tenantId":10,"eventId":5,"orderId":5001,"buyerId":201,"paymentReference":"UPI-777-888","amount":100.00,"expectedAmount":100.00}

### 2. Same request again -> 200 (idempotent replay, same check id)
POST {{gateway}}/api/fraud/checks
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"tenantId":10,"eventId":5,"orderId":5001,"buyerId":201,"paymentReference":"UPI-777-888","amount":100.00,"expectedAmount":100.00}

### 3. Same reference on a different order, wrong amount -> 201, REVIEW_REQUIRED, flag raised
POST {{gateway}}/api/fraud/checks
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"tenantId":10,"eventId":5,"orderId":5002,"buyerId":202,"paymentReference":"upi777888","amount":80.00,"expectedAmount":100.00}

### 4. Student submitting for their own order -> 201, outcome only
POST {{gateway}}/api/fraud/checks
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"tenantId":10,"eventId":5,"orderId":5003,"buyerId":201,"proofImageHash":"9f86d081884c7d659a2feaa0c55ad015a3bf4f1b2b0b822cd15d6c15b0f00a08","amount":100.00}

### 5. Validation error -> 400 with fieldErrors
POST {{gateway}}/api/fraud/checks
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"tenantId":0,"eventId":5,"orderId":1,"buyerId":1,"amount":-1}

### 6. Get a check
GET {{gateway}}/api/fraud/checks/2
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### 7. Organizer review queue (open, high risk first page)
GET {{gateway}}/api/fraud/flags?status=OPEN&riskLevel=HIGH&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### 8. Payment Verification asks: does this order have flags?
GET {{gateway}}/api/fraud/flags?orderId=5002
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}

### 9. Start reviewing
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/fraud/flags/1/review
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"UNDER_REVIEW"}

### 10. Confirm fraud (note required)
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/fraud/flags/1/review
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"CONFIRMED_FRAUD","note":"Reference reused from order 5001"}

### 11. Review a closed flag -> 409
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/fraud/flags/1/review
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"DISMISSED","note":"changed mind"}

### 12. Platform default rules
GET {{gateway}}/api/fraud/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### 13. Rules actually applied to my tenant
GET {{gateway}}/api/fraud/rules/effective
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### 14. Create a tenant override -> 201
POST {{gateway}}/api/fraud/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"tenantId":10,"ruleType":"BUYER_VELOCITY","enabled":true,"threshold":2,"windowMinutes":30,"weight":30,"description":"Max 2 proofs per 30 min"}

### 15. Same override again -> 409
POST {{gateway}}/api/fraud/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"tenantId":10,"ruleType":"BUYER_VELOCITY","enabled":true,"threshold":2,"windowMinutes":30,"weight":30}

### 16. Update the override
PUT {{gateway}}/api/fraud/rules/6
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled":true,"threshold":3,"windowMinutes":30,"weight":30}

### 17. Organizer trying to change a platform default -> 403
PUT {{gateway}}/api/fraud/rules/1
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled":false,"threshold":1,"windowMinutes":0,"weight":70}

### 18. Delete the override -> 204 (tenant falls back to the default)
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/fraud/rules/6
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### 19. No token -> 401
GET {{gateway}}/api/fraud/flags
